  "body": "## What changed\n- Added `OpFrame::pose_in_setup` in `crates/app/src/operation/frame.rs` to compose model pose in the setup alignment frame.\n- Updated `selection_geometry_in` (`crates/app/src/operation/selection.rs`) to read model pose via `OpFrame::pose_in_setup` and stock furniture via `OpFrame::furniture_facets`.\n- Added an explicit `setup: Option<&str>` parameter to `gather_runs` and `stitch_open_runs` (`crates/app/src/operation/stitch.rs`) so stitched open edge runs transform through `OpFrame::pose_in_setup`.\n- Updated `stitched_rings` (`crates/app/src/operation/picks.rs`) to pass `setup::active(world)` to `stitch_open_runs`.\n- Updated `current_stamp`'s `SrcRef::Selection` arm (`crates/app/src/operation/stamp.rs`) to read `setup_align::pose_in` consistently with `SrcRef::Entity`.\n- Removed the `SrcRef::Selection(_)` refusal from `setup_align::generation_problem` (`crates/app/src/setup_align.rs`) while keeping tilted picks, unverified operation kinds, area controls, and non-Mill machines refused.\n- Added `crates/app/tests/opframe_picks.rs`, updated `crates/app/tests/opframe_seam.rs` and `crates/app/tests/setup_align.rs` for Phase 2 behavior, and recorded the design choice in `docs/decisions/763-opframe-phase2-picks.md`.\n\n## Cause\nPhase 1 (`#768`) routed whole-body selections and furniture through `OpFrame` and `setup_align`, leaving `SrcRef::Selection` walks, edge stitching, and selection stamps reading raw document transforms (`model::transform_of` / `facets_of`). Generating a picked operation in an aligned setup hit an explicit Phase 1 refusal in `setup_align::generation_problem` or evaluated features in the wrong frame.\n\n## Tests\n- Pins (`crates/app/tests/opframe_picks.rs`, 4 tests; all 4 failed before the fix and pass after it):\n  - `aligned_face_pick_machines_the_turned_side_and_refuses_the_vertical_top`\n  - `aligned_flipped_pocket_adaptive_and_contour_picks_cut_the_flipped_pocket`\n  - `aligned_stitched_open_runs_and_stamp_staleness`\n  - `tilt_times_picks_and_unverified_and_area_stay_refused_in_phase_two`\n- Updated seam and guard suites pass in quick gate: `opframe_seam` and `setup_align`.\n- Mutation checks (reverted each guard/seam line to `upstream/main`, confirmed pin failed, restored, confirmed pass):\n  - `setup_align.rs`: red -> green\n  - `selection.rs` (`pose_in_setup`): red -> green\n  - `stitch.rs` (`pose_in_setup`): red -> green\n  - `picks.rs` (`setup::active` passed to `stitch_open_runs`): red -> green\n- Gate and lint: `cargo run -p xtask -- gate quick --base upstream/main` passed (`wall 7.9 min, 1 step(s), 0 failed`); `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` exited 0.\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n- Tilted picks (`Tilt x picks`, Phase 3) and aligned area controls (`!op.area.is_default()`, Phase 4) remain intentionally refused.\n- `MultiAxisContour` `drive_chains` still reads `model::transform_of` because `MultiAxisContour` is not a verified aligned kind.\n\n## Overlaps\nNone at PR creation time.\n\nChangelog: Allow picked faces and edges in aligned setups for Face, Contour, Pocket, and Adaptive2D via OpFrame\n\nRefs #763\n",
